00:29:40,960 --> 00:29:42,359
You ran away well.

276
00:29:42,360 --> 00:29:45,159
But I'm going to find you.

277
00:29:50,080 --> 00:29:52,199
Found you.

278
00:30:06,520 --> 00:30:09,159
So you're there...

279
00:30:10,280 --> 00:30:13,519
Come here. I'll have you for iftar.

280
00:31:46,760 --> 00:31:50,599
I heard that two of your most trusted men fought.

281
00:31:50,880 --> 00:31:53,759
I hope that you didn’t get hurt.

282
00:31:58,760 --> 00:32:00,999
. Were you betrayed like me?

283
00:32:01,160 --> 00:32:03,159
There wasn't any betrayal.

284
00:32:03,160 --> 00:32:05,439
You should worry about your traitors.

285
00:32:05,440 --> 00:32:08,079
Worry about the Catalans.

286
00:32:10,480 --> 00:32:11,999
Catalans are close.

287
00:32:12,800 --> 00:32:17,239
As we talked before, I set up the traps.

288
00:32:20,960 --> 00:32:22,199
Come on.

289
00:32:23,120 --> 00:32:24,079
To your positions.

290
00:32:24,080 --> 00:32:25,359
AS you command, my Bey.

291
00:32:25,640 --> 00:32:27,279
Come on alps.

292
00:32:28,640 --> 00:32:30,519
Now..

293
00:32:34,160 --> 00:32:38,199
Tell your man to call the commander.

294
00:33:19,440 --> 00:33:21,519
Kanyumaz, I thought you were dead.

295
00:33:21,520 --> 00:33:24,679
I am not dead, but soon I will be caught.

296
00:33:24,960 --> 00:33:28,759
Osman is looking for the spy. Where is Imren Tegin?

297
00:33:29,080 --> 00:33:31,039
I have important news for him.

298
00:33:31,040 --> 00:33:33,959
Imren Tegin is not here, tell me instead.

299
00:33:36,000 --> 00:33:39,959
Where are my child and my
hatun? I want to see them first.

300
00:33:40,600 --> 00:33:43,799
Kanyumaz! You don't learn your lesson, do you?

301
00:33:44,040 --> 00:33:46,639
Tell me what you know first.

302
00:33:50,760 --> 00:33:53,399
Alaeddin Bey and Mehmet Bey.

303
00:33:53,600 --> 00:33:57,799
They made a deal to take border
bazaar back. They will attack soon.

304
00:33:59,160 --> 00:34:00,879
Osman.

305
00:34:01,320 --> 00:34:04,079
You showed your true colors!

306
00:34:04,720 --> 00:34:07,359
I will inform Imren Tegin about this.

307
00:34:21,560 --> 00:34:23,478
What's going on here?

308
00:34:26,320 --> 00:34:28,638
Is there anyone?

309
00:34:30,360 --> 00:34:33,319
Fire! The tent is on fire!

310
00:34:33,320 --> 00:34:35,399
Bring water quickly!

311
00:34:35,400 --> 00:34:40,599
The tent is on fire!

312
00:34:48,080 --> 00:34:49,518
Mother!

313
00:34:49,520 --> 00:34:51,639
Is there anyone?

314
00:34:54,800 --> 00:34:56,599
Mother!

315
00:35:00,920 --> 00:35:01,959
Bring water!

316
00:35:02,400 --> 00:35:05,799
The dowry! My mother left them to me!

317
00:35:14,280 --> 00:35:17,679
Mother! Is there anyone out there!?

318
00:35:18,880 --> 00:35:21,319
Oh Allah, protect me.

319
00:35:21,520 --> 00:35:23,399
Mother

320
00:35:23,880 --> 00:35:25,399
Mother!

321
00:35:25,880 --> 00:35:28,759
Gazi?

322
00:35:30,360 --> 00:35:32,439
Hold on Gazi!

323
00:35:53,120 --> 00:35:55,519
Is there anyone out there?

324
00:35:57,240 --> 00:35:59,239
Oh Allah help me.

325
00:35:59,520 --> 00:36:02,519
Gazi, wait.

326
00:36:14,440 --> 00:36:16,119
What's happening here?

327
00:36:16,320 --> 00:36:19,919
We heard Gazi, Elcim Hatun went inside.

328
00:36:20,000 --> 00:36:21,519
Gazi?

329
00:36:22,240 --> 00:36:25,239
Pour water! Put out the fire!

330
00:36:25,920 --> 00:36:27,999
Come on!

331
00:36:34,960 --> 00:36:36,959
I am coming!

332
00:36:41,720 --> 00:36:44,759
You are okay, right? We will get out now.

333
00:36:44,760 --> 00:36:47,999
We will get out of here. Come.

334
00:36:49,440 --> 00:36:53,879
Hold onto me.

335
00:36:54,680 --> 00:36:56,519
Don't let go.

336
00:37:17,600 --> 00:37:19,439
Alps, Come on!

337
00:37:22,880 --> 00:37:25,359
Ghazi

338
00:37:27,800 --> 00:37:30,159
Bring water now! Come on!

339
00:37:30,280 --> 00:37:31,599
Come on! Bring water

340
00:37:32,800 --> 00:37:34,599
Elcim! Elcim!

341
00:37:37,120 --> 00:37:37,799
Mother.

342
00:37:37,920 --> 00:37:39,799
Sweetie it's okay.

343
00:37:42,520 --> 00:37:43,359
Mother.

344
00:37:44,560 --> 00:37:46,239
Ghazi

345
00:37:46,600 --> 00:37:47,679
Ghazi

346
00:37:48,440 --> 00:37:49,679
Are you okay my boy?

347
00:37:49,680 --> 00:37:51,159
Ghazi are you okay?

348
00:37:52,000 --> 00:37:53,079
Come on!

349
00:37:53,840 --> 00:37:55,279
I'm here sweetie.

350
00:37:56,120 --> 00:37:57,039
Come on!

351
00:37:57,160 --> 00:37:57,759
Ghazi.

352
00:37:57,760 --> 00:37:58,999
Bring water!

353
00:38:00,320 --> 00:38:00,799
Sweetie.

354
00:38:04,520 --> 00:38:06,719
Come on!

355
00:38:06,720 --> 00:38:08,159
Ghazi.

356
00:38:08,240 --> 00:38:09,759
Ghazi

357
00:38:10,920 --> 00:38:12,399
Sweetie.

358
00:38:12,760 --> 00:38:14,559
I'm fasting!

359
00:38:14,960 --> 00:38:17,079
My boy's fasting.

360
00:38:17,560 --> 00:38:19,079
My boy's fasting. Okay.

361
00:38:19,920 --> 00:38:21,159
I'm here sweetie.

362
00:38:22,280 --> 00:38:23,799
Come on brother!

363
00:38:24,880 --> 00:38:27,359
Alps! Put it out now!

364
00:38:27,360 --> 00:38:28,559
Come on!

365
00:38:36,960 --> 00:38:38,239
Elcim Are you okay?

366
00:38:38,240 --> 00:38:40,239
I'm okay.

367
00:38:41,880 --> 00:38:42,999
Your hands are burnt.

368
00:38:43,280 --> 00:38:44,999
It's okay. Ghazi.

369
00:38:45,280 --> 00:38:46,319
Ghazi are you okay?

370
00:38:47,600 --> 00:38:49,119
Allah bless you.

371
00:38:50,920 --> 00:38:54,199
Allah bless you.
You saved my son.

372
00:38:55,240 --> 00:38:56,519
Do not even mention it.

373
00:38:56,520 --> 00:38:58,039
Anyone would do the same.

374
00:38:58,040 --> 00:38:59,079
No they wouldn’t.

375
00:38:59,440 --> 00:39:01,079
You're so brave..

376
00:39:01,080 --> 00:39:03,079
...that you didn't care for your own life.

377
00:39:07,280 --> 00:39:09,319
But we must get your hands checked.

378
00:39:12,320 --> 00:39:13,279
It hurts.

379
00:39:13,840 --> 00:39:15,999
It hurts.
-It's going to be okay.

380
00:39:21,280 --> 00:39:22,639
The dowry is gone.

381
00:39:26,280 --> 00:39:27,919
My mother left them to us.

382
00:39:28,840 --> 00:39:29,919
How did this happen?

383
00:39:30,960 --> 00:39:32,879
It’s okay, as long as we're safe.

384
00:39:33,400 --> 00:39:34,959
It's not more important than Ghazi.

385
00:39:38,600 --> 00:39:39,599
He's okay.

386
00:39:40,000 --> 00:39:41,359
Malhun Hatun.

387
00:39:42,560 --> 00:39:44,599
We were going to take supplies to Sogut.

388
00:39:45,200 --> 00:39:46,319
Let's not be late.

389
00:39:46,960 --> 00:39:49,719
Not now my girl. You stay. I'll go.

390
00:39:49,720 --> 00:39:51,279
It’s not important. I'll come.

391
00:39:51,640 --> 00:39:52,439
My girl.

392
00:39:53,480 --> 00:39:56,199
You go. We'll protect here.

393
00:39:57,680 --> 00:39:59,599
Okay then. Let's go.

394
00:40:08,200 --> 00:40:09,479
Take it.

395
00:40:09,680 --> 00:40:11,479
Come on sweetie.

396
00:40:14,320 --> 00:40:15,079
Come on.

397
00:40:15,520 --> 00:40:16,519
Let's go.

398
00:40:16,920 --> 00:40:17,919
Let's go.

399
00:40:23,760 --> 00:40:24,959
Bring water!

400
00:41:59,960 --> 00:42:02,239
Catalan commander. Brave Andor.

401
00:42:04,080 --> 00:42:05,559
Imren Tegin awaits you.

402
00:42:06,080 --> 00:42:07,559
Let's go see him.

403
00:42:07,560 --> 00:42:09,559
I wonder what Imren will say.

404
00:42:40,840 --> 00:42:42,519
Imren Tegin.

405
00:42:42,680 --> 00:42:46,159
What is going in that mind of yours
which had fooled Olcay Tuhan before?

406
00:42:46,320 --> 00:42:47,759
Why did you call me here?

407
00:42:47,760 --> 00:42:49,559
I didn't.

408
00:42:49,680 --> 00:42:53,639
My partner wanted to talk face
to face with the Catalan dogs.

409
00:42:53,800 --> 00:42:56,879
What? Partner?

410
00:43:02,440 --> 00:43:06,119
Welcome to the Turks' land, commander.

411
00:43:06,720 --> 00:43:09,639
But you won't be staying here for long.

412
00:43:09,760 --> 00:43:11,079
Who are you?

413
00:43:11,080 --> 00:43:12,879
Your executioner.

414
00:43:13,480 --> 00:43:15,639
What does this mean Imren?

415
00:43:20,720 --> 00:43:23,359
These lands you've stepped on will be-your end.

416
00:43:27,600 --> 00:43:29,479
Alps, attack

417
00:43:46,160 --> 00:43:48,359
Allah is the Greatest!

418
00:44:16,280 --> 00:44:17,759
Wait.

419
00:44:24,640 --> 00:44:25,879
Wait.

420
00:44:35,320 --> 00:44:38,119
Now.

421
00:44:41,240 --> 00:44:43,559
Now you're in the palms of our hands.

422
00:44:43,560 --> 00:44:45,079
Allah.

423
00:44:45,080 --> 00:44:47,079
Come on brothers.

424
00:44:50,600 --> 00:44:52,839
Allah.

425
00:44:56,040 --> 00:44:57,919
Allah is the Greatest!

426
00:44:57,920 --> 00:45:02,919
-Allah is the Greatest!
-Allah is the Greatest!

427
00:45:38,360 --> 00:45:39,879
Why did you betray us?

428
00:45:39,880 --> 00:45:42,079
What are you talking about?

429
00:45:42,080 --> 00:45:44,079
We do not ask questions to traitors.

430
00:45:44,080 --> 00:45:45,999
We just severe their heads from their bodies.

431
00:45:52,320 --> 00:45:54,559
He got what he deserved.

432
00:46:27,520 --> 00:46:29,479
Good work.

433
00:46:31,760 --> 00:46:33,959
How much is this?

434
00:46:34,320 --> 00:46:35,959
What is it Boran Bey?

435
00:46:35,960 --> 00:46:40,359
Is there no more bows in Osman Bey's
post that you're buying one from me?

436
00:46:40,560 --> 00:46:43,959
Are you selling it or not, tell me that.

437
00:46:44,480 --> 00:46:47,079
20 silver coins, my bey.

438
00:46:48,320 --> 00:46:50,039
Okay.

439
00:46:50,920 --> 00:46:53,439
Show me your swords too.

440
00:46:56,080 --> 00:46:57,879
What about the horseshoes?

441
00:46:57,880 --> 00:47:00,439
I just put them on, you'll be
using them for a long time.

442
00:47:00,440 --> 00:47:02,679
Thank you.

443
00:47:05,840 --> 00:47:08,239
Here, thank you.

444
00:47:16,840 --> 00:47:18,599
Thank you.

445
00:47:32,920 --> 00:47:34,839
Peace be with you.

446
00:47:35,360 --> 00:47:36,999
Good day.

447
00:47:37,000 --> 00:47:39,439
Thanks, my Bey. Welcome.

448
00:47:39,800 --> 00:47:42,319
Show me your best sword.

449
00:47:43,760 --> 00:47:49,239
My Bey, I forged this myself. It has
two gutters. This is my best sword.

450
00:47:57,880 --> 00:48:02,439
My Bey, the victory is ours. We
defeated all of them Alhamdulillah.

451
00:48:02,680 --> 00:48:05,559
Thank you, you got a great victory, son.

452
00:48:05,720 --> 00:48:06,839
Thank you my Bey.

453
00:48:06,840 --> 00:48:08,759
Well done.

454
00:48:10,080 --> 00:48:14,239
Your son is brave just like you, Osman Bey.

455
00:48:16,400 --> 00:48:18,399
Your father Ertugrul...

456
00:48:20,880 --> 00:48:21,679
...Ghazi.

457
00:48:21,680 --> 00:48:23,759
Watch it!

458
00:48:24,640 --> 00:48:26,879
Don't casually utter his name!

459
00:48:29,080 --> 00:48:32,119
Didn't he obey Seljuk state, too?

460
00:48:33,520 --> 00:48:37,879
During the time of Seljuk
state, the Turks were glorious.

461
00:48:38,080 --> 00:48:40,999
Can't you pledge loyalty to me and stand behind me?

462
00:48:41,120 --> 00:48:43,519
The times changed.

463
00:48:45,400 --> 00:48:49,799
While you were betraying
others, we made our lands bigger.

464
00:48:51,000 --> 00:48:53,119
Don't have such futile dreams.

465
00:48:53,480 --> 00:48:57,479
But if you still want to be united..

466
00:48:58,360 --> 00:49:02,309
..here, kiss my hand, and
I will accept your pledge.

467
00:49:05,080 --> 00:49:08,279
So this unity will always be a dream, huh?

468
00:49:10,880 --> 00:49:12,919
Yeah.

469
00:49:13,600 --> 00:49:17,519
What if the people you trust betray you too?

470
00:49:17,960 --> 00:49:19,999
What will you do then?

471
00:49:20,000 --> 00:49:22,759
I will bring the new comers to Border bazaar.

472
00:49:22,760 --> 00:49:25,079
I don't want any rebels in my castle.

473
00:49:26,120 --> 00:49:29,239
Ambassadors in Atranos and the
Cardinal will go to border bazaar too.

474
00:49:29,600 --> 00:49:32,119
It will bring courage to the soldiers.

475
00:49:32,120 --> 00:49:34,079
Not at a time like this.

476
00:49:34,960 --> 00:49:38,039
Orhan and alps will accompany them.

477
00:49:38,040 --> 00:49:39,519
As you command, my Bey.

478
00:49:39,760 --> 00:49:42,119
Take good care of my Cardinal, Orhan!

479
00:49:42,920 --> 00:49:44,599
Come on alps!

480
00:49:56,600 --> 00:49:59,239
Before they realize what’s
happening, we will take them down.

481
00:49:59,240 --> 00:50:00,839
Everyone knows what to do. Come on.

482
00:50:00,840 --> 00:50:02,599
Alright my Bey.

483
00:50:10,120 --> 00:50:12,599
We gained a great victory together.

484
00:50:12,920 --> 00:50:15,359
When are you going to tell
me the location of my relics?

485
00:50:15,600 --> 00:50:20,039
When the crusaders get out of my lands...

486
00:50:20,760 --> 00:50:23,319
...you will take your relics.

487
00:50:23,320 --> 00:50:25,959
Those who come will be
destroyed eventually, Osman Bey.

488
00:50:26,120 --> 00:50:30,079
But if this goes on, this
campaign will last longer.

489
00:50:41,680 --> 00:50:43,239
What's the hurry?

490
00:50:51,400 --> 00:50:55,279
I could buy the necessities. I wish you
had stayed back there, Holofira Hatun.

491
00:50:55,520 --> 00:50:57,839
Holofira is dead, Kismet.

492
00:50:57,840 --> 00:51:00,199
Holofira is no more.

493
00:51:02,200 --> 00:51:05,239
Malhun Hatun is coming!

494
00:51:05,920 --> 00:51:08,839
Welcome Malhun Hatun

495
00:51:10,920 --> 00:51:13,799
Thank you!

496
00:51:14,040 --> 00:51:17,599
Elcim Hatun is with her. It
will end badly if they see you.

497
00:51:18,840 --> 00:51:21,519
What are they doing here?

498
00:51:21,520 --> 00:51:23,359
Thank you.

499
00:51:24,640 --> 00:51:26,559
Why did they come?

500
00:51:26,920 --> 00:51:29,719
Let's leave, Holofira Hatun, they will see us.

501
00:51:32,720 --> 00:51:34,839
He tricked me.

502
00:51:35,200 --> 00:51:38,199
He made me kill the Catalans!

503
00:51:44,680 --> 00:51:47,399
That dog is telling Imren something.

504
00:51:47,960 --> 00:51:52,039
Let's be on alert. We have to leave here.

505
00:51:52,160 --> 00:51:53,479
As you command my Bey.

506
00:51:53,480 --> 00:51:55,079
Prepare the horses.

507
00:51:55,520 --> 00:51:57,119
Alps.

508
00:52:04,440 --> 00:52:06,159
Osman!

509
00:52:10,360 --> 00:52:12,279
You acted as my ally!

510
00:52:12,920 --> 00:52:15,919
You attacked the Frenks, too, right?

511
00:52:16,680 --> 00:52:18,839
Now you understand.

512
00:52:23,440 --> 00:52:24,959
You found the Frenks.

513
00:52:25,800 --> 00:52:27,599
You made me kill Catalans.

514
00:52:28,240 --> 00:52:30,919
Now you sent your son after Cardinal messengers.

515
00:52:32,080 --> 00:52:33,239
Osman!

516
00:52:34,480 --> 00:52:36,519
What kind of a game is this?

517
00:52:36,520 --> 00:52:39,279
I'll kill you right here.

518
00:52:39,280 --> 00:52:40,759
Soldiers!

519
00:52:47,600 --> 00:52:50,399
Will you disregard messengers and relics?

520
00:52:50,720 --> 00:52:53,679
You set this plan to save your lands.

521
00:52:54,000 --> 00:52:55,679
In return...

522
00:52:55,800 --> 00:52:59,199
...I will burn this land with the crusaders.

523
00:52:59,200 --> 00:53:01,199
I won't let them pass!

524
00:53:02,080 --> 00:53:04,039
And you can't hurt me.

525
00:53:04,320 --> 00:53:06,039
We’ll go on until one of us die.

526
00:53:08,320 --> 00:53:09,559
Let's go.

527
00:53:09,720 --> 00:53:10,799
Then..

528
00:53:11,360 --> 00:53:14,759
...you'll breathe until you
tell me where the relics are.

529
00:53:15,280 --> 00:53:18,599
First, your son who went
after the cardinals will die.

530
00:53:18,680 --> 00:53:20,159
Orhan dies!

531
00:53:20,720 --> 00:53:21,639
Daniel.

532
00:53:22,120 --> 00:53:23,639
Sent your best men.

533
00:53:24,200 --> 00:53:26,559
Bring me Orhan's head.

534
00:53:26,800 --> 00:53:28,559
They'll kill all the Alps.

535
00:53:29,280 --> 00:53:31,239
Osman will have iftar...

536
00:53:31,240 --> 00:53:33,039
..with his son's head.

537
00:53:33,120 --> 00:53:34,599
As you wish Imren Tegin.

538
00:53:34,640 --> 00:53:35,799
Take position!

539
00:53:40,840 --> 00:53:42,319
Alright then.

540
00:53:44,280 --> 00:53:45,399
Cerkutay.

541
00:53:45,480 --> 00:53:46,279
My Bey.

542
00:53:46,680 --> 00:53:50,039
I guess we'll reach shahada side by side.

543
00:53:50,280 --> 00:53:53,359
Dying by your side is an honor my Bey.

544
00:53:54,520 --> 00:53:56,199
But one of us...

545
00:53:56,840 --> 00:53:58,639
...must send word to Orhan.

546
00:53:59,520 --> 00:54:00,359
Osman!

547
00:54:01,080 --> 00:54:03,199
The one next to you will die first.

548
00:54:04,120 --> 00:54:06,279
Everyone who knows your name will die.

549
00:54:06,280 --> 00:54:08,559
Will you keep waiting?

550
00:54:10,720 --> 00:54:13,039
We’ll chase these dogs into the forest.

551
00:54:13,480 --> 00:54:16,119
We’ll kill them one
by one like wolves.

552
00:54:16,120 --> 00:54:16,919
Attack!

553
00:54:17,040 --> 00:54:18,159
Release the horses!

554
00:54:34,400 --> 00:54:36,039
Allah bless you.

555
00:54:36,040 --> 00:54:38,039
All of us, if Allah permits.

556
00:54:38,400 --> 00:54:41,039
Osman Bey sent his regards.

557
00:54:41,080 --> 00:54:42,439
Allah bless you.

558
00:54:42,440 --> 00:54:44,439
Ramadan Mubarak!

559
00:54:52,840 --> 00:54:53,999
My girl.

560
00:54:54,680 --> 00:54:55,079
Come.

561
00:54:56,640 --> 00:54:59,759
You'll be in pain if you move it.

562
00:54:59,760 --> 00:55:01,759
Stay still until it gets better.

563
00:55:03,720 --> 00:55:05,239
Thank Allah..

564
00:55:05,760 --> 00:55:08,519
...He protected us from worse situations.

565
00:55:08,520 --> 00:55:09,959
Ghazi is alright.

566
00:55:10,760 --> 00:55:13,119
I was so scared when I saw him in flames.

567
00:55:15,080 --> 00:55:17,399
That fear.... My girl...

568
00:55:17,800 --> 00:55:19,359
Know that fear well..

569
00:55:20,080 --> 00:55:23,319
When you have a child, you’ll
spend your life with that fear.

570
00:55:27,040 --> 00:55:28,639
When I lost my mother...

571
00:55:30,000 --> 00:55:32,999
...I thought I'd never have
anyone else in her place.

572
00:55:35,480 --> 00:55:37,039
You're a mother to me.

573
00:55:37,600 --> 00:55:40,039
You're a daughter to me, my girl.

574
00:55:46,280 --> 00:55:48,039
I won't worry anymore.

575
00:55:48,320 --> 00:55:51,079
Orhan and you will protect each other.

576
00:55:54,560 --> 00:55:56,879
Keep respecting each other.

577
00:55:57,040 --> 00:55:59,959
May your respect bear love.

578
00:56:01,120 --> 00:56:02,679
I hope so Malhun Hatun.

579
00:56:03,920 --> 00:56:07,799
Then, stop calling me Hatun.

580
00:56:10,520 --> 00:56:11,879
Mother Malhun.

581
00:56:12,080 --> 00:56:13,879
That's right.

582
00:56:16,720 --> 00:56:19,279
Come my girl. Come here.

583
00:56:19,840 --> 00:56:22,399
I know it's not like your mother's dowry...

584
00:56:22,600 --> 00:56:24,999
...but Sogut's Hatuns are good at it.

585
00:56:27,680 --> 00:56:30,079
They really are pretty.

586
00:56:30,080 --> 00:56:32,079
Right. They are.

587
00:56:33,120 --> 00:56:34,239
Come on.

588
00:56:34,240 --> 00:56:36,239
Let's get you new dowry.

589
00:56:41,960 --> 00:56:44,759
Come here Imren. Come here.

590
00:56:45,080 --> 00:56:46,159
Give me the flying fire.

591
00:56:47,000 --> 00:56:47,959
My Bey.

592
00:56:48,680 --> 00:56:50,839
Come on! Come on!

593
00:56:52,320 --> 00:56:54,919
Alps! Make them retreat!

594
00:57:02,040 --> 00:57:05,359
We’ll turn these dogs into birds and they'll fly.

595
00:57:05,360 --> 00:57:08,199
Or they’ll surround us.

596
00:57:08,200 --> 00:57:09,479
Don't you worry.

597
00:57:09,760 --> 00:57:11,319
We’ll make them fly like thirds.

598
00:57:11,320 --> 00:57:13,319
Imren Tegin will be gone like he deserves.

599
00:57:16,520 --> 00:57:19,039
Orhan is in danger. We have to go to him.

600
00:57:25,640 --> 00:57:27,599
They're going to take flight.

601
00:57:55,520 --> 00:57:57,399
Alps.

602
00:57:57,400 --> 00:57:58,999
Take cover.

603
00:58:35,560 --> 00:58:37,919
Kill them all.

604
00:58:38,520 --> 00:58:40,559
Come here Imren.

605
00:58:40,560 --> 00:58:42,959
Let's see how well you fly.

606
00:58:42,960 --> 00:58:44,999
My bey, they're coming.

607
00:58:45,800 --> 00:58:47,759
They're coming closer.

608
00:59:06,280 --> 00:59:08,599
Alps, come on.

609
00:59:12,920 --> 00:59:14,439
Brother, come.

610
00:59:14,440 --> 00:59:16,439
Come on brother.

611
00:59:21,640 --> 00:59:23,199
Come on.

612
00:59:30,040 --> 00:59:31,799
Bring the horses.

613
00:59:31,800 --> 00:59:34,239
No one will leave this forest alive.

614
00:59:36,800 --> 00:59:41,679
It hurts, Gonca Hatun, it hurts. It hurts so much.

615
00:59:42,000 --> 00:59:44,399
It hurts, Gonca Hatun.

616
00:59:44,400 --> 00:59:48,679
Poor soul, look at him...

617
00:59:51,080 --> 00:59:53,679
I didn't even touch it yet, Ghazi.

618
00:59:53,840 --> 00:59:56,279
You can't stand pain at all.

619
00:59:56,280 --> 00:59:58,279
Right Gonca Hatun?

620
00:59:59,080 --> 01:00:03,159
Don't you see that huge wound Alaeddin Bey?

621
01:00:03,840 --> 01:00:07,239
Ghazi is holding on so well, he's so brave.

622
01:00:07,920 --> 01:00:10,879
He's jealous of me, my Gonca.

623
01:00:11,200 --> 01:00:12,919
You...

624
01:00:13,040 --> 01:00:15,319
All of my mother's work is gone.

625
01:00:15,320 --> 01:00:17,999
There's nothing left.

626
01:00:18,640 --> 01:00:21,159
How did that fire start?

627
01:00:21,920 --> 01:00:23,999
How did you burn down that tent?

628
01:00:24,000 --> 01:00:26,359
What will we do now?

629
01:00:26,560 --> 01:00:28,719
I didn't burn it, mother.

630
01:00:28,720 --> 01:00:30,719
I was chasing that goat.

631
01:00:30,720 --> 01:00:33,719
I went inside that tent and
someone hit me on the head.

632
01:00:33,720 --> 01:00:35,839
I just fell to the ground.

633
01:00:37,920 --> 01:00:39,719
Who hit you?

634
01:00:39,720 --> 01:00:42,759
Who could it be? He must be lying.

635
01:00:42,760 --> 01:00:43,999
I swear I'm not.

636
01:00:44,000 --> 01:00:45,399
Come here.

637
01:00:49,000 --> 01:00:51,079
He has a bump.

638
01:00:51,080 --> 01:00:53,239
Who hit you, did you see?

639
01:00:53,240 --> 01:00:54,719
I didn't.

640
01:00:54,720 --> 01:00:56,639
But they are a coward.

641
01:00:56,640 --> 01:00:59,919
They attacked me from the back.

642
01:01:00,040 --> 01:01:01,559
Such a brave kid.

643
01:01:01,720 --> 01:01:04,879
Why would anyone want to burn down the dowery?

644
01:01:05,080 --> 01:01:06,679
Ghazi.

645
01:01:06,920 --> 01:01:09,479
Could it be that you hit your head?

646
01:01:09,480 --> 01:01:11,879
I swear they hit me.

647
01:01:12,000 --> 01:01:15,559
You're right, he must be saying
these things because of the shock.

648
01:01:15,720 --> 01:01:16,999
Okay Ghazi.

649
01:01:17,000 --> 01:01:20,239
You did something, just own up to it and apologize.

650
01:01:21,600 --> 01:01:23,439
Okay Ghazi's mother.

651
01:01:23,440 --> 01:01:26,199
I believe you Ghazi.

652
01:01:36,400 --> 01:01:38,319
The horses rested for enough.

653
01:01:38,320 --> 01:01:41,439
We still have a long way to go to Atranos.

654
01:01:55,120 --> 01:01:56,639
Alps.

655
01:01:57,240 --> 01:01:59,399
Something’s happening.

656
01:01:59,760 --> 01:02:02,759
Be cautious and get ready.

657
01:02:10,280 --> 01:02:12,279
What are you whispering about?

658
01:02:12,320 --> 01:02:13,919
Tell us so we know too.

659
01:02:13,920 --> 01:02:15,999
We’re talking about your betrayal.

660
01:02:16,000 --> 01:02:17,679
Osman Bey's betrayal.

661
01:02:17,680 --> 01:02:20,759
But he is paying for it with his life now.

662
01:02:20,760 --> 01:02:22,279
Just like you.

663
01:02:22,840 --> 01:02:24,799
Father...

664
01:02:25,120 --> 01:02:26,439
Soldiers.

665
01:02:26,440 --> 01:02:29,239
Alps.

666
01:02:30,320 --> 01:02:32,199
I'll be the one killing you.

667
01:02:32,200 --> 01:02:32,959
Attack.

668
01:02:32,960 --> 01:02:33,999
Allah is the Greatest!

669
01:02:34,000 --> 01:02:35,799
Oh Allah!

670
01:03:21,680 --> 01:03:24,639
Hold on my Bey! We are coming!

671
01:03:26,240 --> 01:03:29,039
Come on alps!

672
01:03:30,640 --> 01:03:33,759
Come on Cerkutay.

673
01:03:34,000 --> 01:03:35,799
We will split in two here.

674
01:03:35,960 --> 01:03:40,719
Cerkutay, we have no horses, and no
time. We need to inform Orhan quickly.

675
01:03:41,000 --> 01:03:43,399
He will be informed, my Bey.

676
01:03:43,400 --> 01:03:44,399
Thank you.

677
01:03:44,400 --> 01:03:46,719
Don't worry, you will be okay.

678
01:03:46,720 --> 01:03:47,879
Alright my Bey.

679
01:03:47,880 --> 01:03:50,279
3 alps will accompany Cerkutay Bey.

680
01:03:50,440 --> 01:03:53,519
Come on brothers. Hold on.

681
01:03:53,920 --> 01:03:56,039
The rest is with me.

682
01:04:00,960 --> 01:04:03,719
Those who want to die come face us, huh?

683
01:04:03,720 --> 01:04:04,719
Come here!

684
01:04:08,560 --> 01:04:10,759
Come on alps!

685
01:04:30,160 --> 01:04:33,519
My shahzade, aren't we going to help them?

686
01:04:34,600 --> 01:04:39,799
Helping him and not helping
him, both are problems for me.

687
01:04:40,840 --> 01:04:44,679
If Orhan dies, Osman will be left alone.

688
01:04:45,040 --> 01:04:46,879
And that will be useful for me.

689
01:05:04,200 --> 01:05:06,759
My shahzade!

690
01:05:15,960 --> 01:05:19,999
Hold on alps! Osman Bey is waiting for us!

691
01:05:45,360 --> 01:05:47,079
You came right on time, Mehmet Bey!

692
01:05:47,080 --> 01:05:50,039
We are going to kill that dog
Imren together, Orhan Bey.

693
01:05:50,040 --> 01:05:54,159
Allah is the Greatest!

694
01:06:49,800 --> 01:06:53,479
Come here!

695
01:07:23,760 --> 01:07:27,799
You have nowhere fo escape,
Osman, stop making plans.

696
01:07:28,320 --> 01:07:30,999
I am not running away.

697
01:07:31,440 --> 01:07:35,519
I was just planning how to kill you.

698
01:07:38,080 --> 01:07:41,319
Come here!

699
01:08:40,040 --> 01:08:41,519
Hang on brother.

700
01:08:41,560 --> 01:08:42,278
Hang on.

701
01:08:42,520 --> 01:08:44,759
Hang on brother. Hang on.

702
01:08:44,760 --> 01:08:45,999
Alps!

703
01:08:47,960 --> 01:08:49,519
Hang on brother.

704
01:08:55,880 --> 01:08:58,078
End of the road, Cerkutay.

705
01:08:58,080 --> 01:08:59,359
Have some rest.

706
01:09:01,240 --> 01:09:02,679
You're lucky.

707
01:09:02,800 --> 01:09:04,679
You'll die before Osman.

708
01:09:04,720 --> 01:09:05,919
No.

709
01:09:06,200 --> 01:09:08,679
You're the lucky man.

710
01:09:08,920 --> 01:09:10,679
Because you'll die by my hand.

711
01:09:13,439 --> 01:09:15,439
To get to Osman Bey...

712
01:09:16,279 --> 01:09:17,799
...you have crush me first.

713
01:09:18,120 --> 01:09:19,479
Then I will.

714
01:09:19,720 --> 01:09:20,559
Attack!

715
01:09:51,200 --> 01:09:54,158
They found Osman.
They're going to Yildiz Kaya.

716
01:09:55,160 --> 01:09:56,879
Take me to him.

717
01:09:57,000 --> 01:09:58,399
I want him alive.

718
01:10:02,760 --> 01:10:03,839
My Bey.

719
01:10:43,920 --> 01:10:45,639
The Righteous

720
01:10:47,600 --> 01:10:49,559
Praise be.

721
01:10:51,280 --> 01:10:53,399
You hit the target each time Fatma.

722
01:10:53,400 --> 01:10:56,039
Well... I better do it brother.

723
01:10:56,240 --> 01:10:58,039
I train all the time.

724
01:10:59,520 --> 01:11:01,399
The Righteous

725
01:11:05,960 --> 01:11:07,439
Praise be my sister.

726
01:11:18,320 --> 01:11:20,439
What will you do about Gonca?

727
01:11:22,040 --> 01:11:25,999
Will you do what my brother did, will you...
-Don't say it sister.

728
01:11:28,920 --> 01:11:31,559
I go crazy when I hear
someone else's name beside hers.

729
01:11:32,640 --> 01:11:35,199
I don't even know what I'll do if I see her...

730
01:11:35,200 --> 01:11:36,239
...with someone else.

731
01:11:36,760 --> 01:11:39,959
If you do nothing and wait here...

732
01:11:39,960 --> 01:11:41,639
...the day will come soon.

733
01:11:42,400 --> 01:11:44,039
I know what to do sister.

734
01:11:46,800 --> 01:11:48,959
I won't let you go trickster Hatun.

735
01:11:49,440 --> 01:11:50,799
I won't let you go.

736
01:11:55,840 --> 01:11:56,559
Gonca.

737
01:11:57,120 --> 01:11:59,119
Gohca just wait and listen to me.

738
01:12:00,440 --> 01:12:02,599
You and I are two separate rivers.

739
01:12:03,080 --> 01:12:04,839
Now we meet again.

740
01:12:05,800 --> 01:12:08,079
You and I can't-be separated now Gonca.

741
01:12:10,320 --> 01:12:11,319
We are one.

742
01:12:16,000 --> 01:12:16,879
Alaeddin.

743
01:12:18,840 --> 01:12:19,999
You know what would happen.

744
01:12:20,640 --> 01:12:23,519
-We cannot fight this war -Why not?

745
01:12:23,600 --> 01:12:24,639
Why not?

746
01:12:24,880 --> 01:12:26,919
You and I agreed to fight together.

747
01:12:27,680 --> 01:12:29,119
You are willing to fight all?

748
01:12:31,240 --> 01:12:32,559
And your father and mother?

749
01:12:35,360 --> 01:12:38,399
Will you be able to stand against them Alaeddin?

750
01:12:38,400 --> 01:12:40,439
What don't you understand?

751
01:12:40,440 --> 01:12:42,079
They don't trust me.

752
01:12:42,080 --> 01:12:44,079
Gonca.

753
01:12:44,080 --> 01:12:46,079
I made a promise to you.

754
01:12:46,280 --> 01:12:48,279
Do you remember?

755
01:12:49,880 --> 01:12:53,119
I'll always be with you.

756
01:12:54,160 --> 01:12:55,599
No.

757
01:12:58,360 --> 01:12:59,439
You can't leave them.

758
01:12:59,440 --> 01:13:02,439
I won't leave you
either Gonca, I won't.

759
01:13:02,440 --> 01:13:04,759
You're my home.

760
01:13:05,320 --> 01:13:07,039
You're my first love.

761
01:13:12,480 --> 01:13:15,519
As long as'this soul is in this body...

762
01:13:16,840 --> 01:13:20,119
...you will be my only love.

763
01:13:20,280 --> 01:13:21,759
Madrasah student...

764
01:13:21,760 --> 01:13:23,759
Look, just say you want this...

765
01:13:23,760 --> 01:13:25,599
...then I'll talk with my father.

766
01:13:25,600 --> 01:13:29,719
Just say yes and I'll talk with Yakup
Bey, I've thought about all of that.

767
01:13:31,080 --> 01:13:32,679
But..

768
01:13:33,160 --> 01:13:35,839
...give me an answer first.

769
01:13:37,680 --> 01:13:40,279
...we have to go against our families...

770
01:13:42,160 --> 01:13:46,479
...will you be able to give up on
everything and say yes to me Gonca?

771
01:13:51,720 --> 01:13:54,079
Madrasah student...

772
01:14:00,360 --> 01:14:03,239
I'm ready to fight for this love...

773
01:14:03,400 --> 01:14:05,119
...but...
-There is no but.

774
01:14:05,120 --> 01:14:07,799
There is no but Gonca..

775
01:14:09,880 --> 01:14:12,239
I have only one chance.

776
01:14:14,440 --> 01:14:16,239
Are you in...

777
01:14:17,960 --> 01:14:19,359
...or out?

778
01:14:27,560 --> 01:14:28,759
I'm in.

779
01:14:29,360 --> 01:14:30,359
I am in.

780
01:14:32,000 --> 01:14:33,999
I'll walk this path with you.

781
01:14:34,000 --> 01:14:35,999
-Gonca.
-No matter the ending, madrasah student.

782
01:14:36,000 --> 01:14:37,519
-Gonca.
-Alaeddin.

783
01:14:39,240 --> 01:14:40,679
Come on.

784
01:14:40,680 --> 01:14:42,479
Go talk with Osman Bey.

785
01:14:42,480 --> 01:14:44,279
I'll go...But...

786
01:14:45,120 --> 01:14:46,559
...don’t change your mind again.

787
01:14:46,560 --> 01:14:47,759
-No.
-Okay.

788
01:14:50,200 --> 01:14:52,679
Then give me a promise of love.

789
01:14:53,520 --> 01:14:57,559
Will you swear on all the love stories?

790
01:15:00,640 --> 01:15:03,959
I swear on all the love stories.

791
01:15:03,960 --> 01:15:05,959
Gonca.

792
01:15:09,160 --> 01:15:10,799
Okay.

793
01:15:10,800 --> 01:15:13,199
I'll go and talk with my father then.

794
01:15:13,200 --> 01:15:14,999
Go on.

795
01:15:15,000 --> 01:15:16,279
i'll go.

796
01:15:16,280 --> 01:15:17,799
I'll go Gonca.

797
01:15:17,800 --> 01:15:19,159
Gonca.

798
01:15:20,840 --> 01:15:21,999
Gonca.

799
01:15:24,480 --> 01:15:27,679
Allah...

800
01:15:31,400 --> 01:15:34,559
Thank Allah...

801
01:15:37,320 --> 01:15:39,559
Gonca.

802
01:15:40,640 --> 01:15:43,599
Allah.

803
01:15:52,040 --> 01:15:54,759
Thank Allah.

804
01:15:54,920 --> 01:15:57,039
I will go and talk with my father.

805
01:16:16,800 --> 01:16:20,159
I told you there was nowhere to run Osman.

806
01:16:27,280 --> 01:16:29,239
Cerkutay died.

807
01:16:29,240 --> 01:16:31,519
Your alps died.

808
01:16:32,080 --> 01:16:34,199
And finally...

809
01:16:34,240 --> 01:16:37,079
...your son, Shahzade Orhan.

810
01:16:37,480 --> 01:16:39,399
He died too.

811
01:16:40,040 --> 01:16:43,679
The only reason you're alive is my relics.

812
01:16:44,000 --> 01:16:47,319
If not you'd be dead already.

813
01:16:48,280 --> 01:16:50,839
Forget touching my son...

814
01:16:51,040 --> 01:16:54,319
..you can't even cut my beard.

815
01:16:56,640 --> 01:16:59,119
I'm going to kill you in such a way...

816
01:16:59,320 --> 01:17:02,079
In such a way...

817
01:17:09,920 --> 01:17:12,159
You're resisting for nothing Osman.

818
01:17:12,360 --> 01:17:14,639
Resisting comes from belief.

819
01:17:14,680 --> 01:17:16,839
I'll never surrender.

820
01:17:33,760 --> 01:17:35,839
I'm going to kill you in such a way...

821
01:17:36,240 --> 01:17:38,519
In such a way...

822
01:17:41,440 --> 01:17:44,119
I hope it's nothing bad.

823
01:17:46,720 --> 01:17:48,519
Bala Hatun, Malhun Hatun.

824
01:17:48,640 --> 01:17:49,479
What is it?

825
01:17:49,520 --> 01:17:52,479
Imren's men learned the
plan. They attacked Orhan Bey.

826
01:17:52,480 --> 01:17:54,599
What are you saying?

827
01:17:55,680 --> 01:17:59,719
Mehmet Bey saved shahzade
Orhan the last minute, but...

828
01:18:02,080 --> 01:18:05,799
...Osman Bey is in a tough position.
They are attacking from all sides.

829
01:18:05,800 --> 01:18:06,879
What?

830
01:18:08,280 --> 01:18:09,959
Bala!

831
01:18:11,080 --> 01:18:15,519
Alps! Sisters! To horses! We
are going to support Osman Bey!

832
01:18:15,520 --> 01:18:16,639
Come on!

833
01:18:17,240 --> 01:18:19,959
Bring me my sword!

834
01:18:24,240 --> 01:18:26,479
I won't leave you alone, mother!

835
01:18:26,680 --> 01:18:28,599
No, Alaeddin. Stay here.

836
01:18:28,600 --> 01:18:30,999
The infidels,will come for our cities.

837
01:18:31,120 --> 01:18:33,919
Your duty here is more important.

838
01:18:34,280 --> 01:18:36,799
Your father entrusted the tribe to you.

839
01:18:39,040 --> 01:18:40,719
May Allah protect you.

840
01:18:40,800 --> 01:18:43,079
Come on.

841
01:18:54,920 --> 01:18:57,159
Oh Allah, protect them.

842
01:19:08,840 --> 01:19:12,199
Oh Allah, don't let my people suffer...

843
01:19:12,520 --> 01:19:15,199
...from losing their Bey, and don't
let me suffer from losing my father.

844
01:19:18,040 --> 01:19:21,919
My shahzade, Osman Bey
and Cerkutay Bey were not there.

845
01:19:22,720 --> 01:19:25,559
It's impossible that they know
about Osman Bey’s move.

846
01:19:25,560 --> 01:19:28,039
My shahzade, there is something else going on.

847
01:19:28,600 --> 01:19:30,679
Well, they are bastards, after all.

848
01:19:30,680 --> 01:19:34,079
They need no reason to attack Osman Bey.

849
01:19:35,040 --> 01:19:37,599
Someone told Imren about our move.

850
01:19:37,600 --> 01:19:39,839
There is a traitor among us.

851
01:19:40,200 --> 01:19:42,199
I will find that traitor!

852
01:19:42,200 --> 01:19:45,039
I will find him and punish him!

853
01:19:45,320 --> 01:19:46,839
But first..

854
01:19:47,520 --> 01:19:50,039
...first we will find Osman Bey.

855
01:19:53,280 --> 01:19:55,599
They released the horses to escape, my shahzade.

856
01:19:55,920 --> 01:19:59,159
Imren will not leave their
trail before he gets the relics.

857
01:19:59,400 --> 01:20:01,799
We will find my father before that dog

858
01:20:04,560 --> 01:20:07,359
My shahzade, there are traces here!

859
01:20:07,680 --> 01:20:09,439
They lead to the forest.

860
01:20:14,160 --> 01:20:17,119
Move away!

861
01:20:22,760 --> 01:20:26,799
We won’t stop until we find
them. Everyone, to your horses!

862
01:20:38,840 --> 01:20:43,319
We won’t stop until we find Osman Bey! Come on!

863
01:21:01,600 --> 01:21:03,559
Imren Tegin, or whatever your name is!

864
01:21:03,880 --> 01:21:05,199
Come here!

865
01:21:05,200 --> 01:21:08,199
Stop.

866
01:21:08,640 --> 01:21:10,359
Don't interfere.

867
01:21:13,720 --> 01:21:15,599
He is mine.

868
01:21:59,040 --> 01:22:01,239
Capture him!

869
01:22:30,880 --> 01:22:33,639
You are'gping with my relics,. Osman.

870
01:22:39,720 --> 01:22:41,399
The end of an era!

871
01:23:05,160 --> 01:23:06,559
Make sure he's dead.

872
01:23:41,600 --> 01:23:43,479
Allah protect him.

873
01:23:43,560 --> 01:23:45,879
Cerkutay Bey! Cerkutay Bey!

874
01:23:46,240 --> 01:23:47,879
Cerkutay.

875
01:23:48,200 --> 01:23:49,519
Cerkutay! Brother!

876
01:23:49,520 --> 01:23:51,999
Bring me a cloth! Come on!

877
01:23:52,720 --> 01:23:54,879
Cerkutay. Brother open your eyes!

878
01:23:55,160 --> 01:23:55,919
Open your eyes!

879
01:23:55,920 --> 01:23:57,399
What will we do my shehzade?

880
01:23:57,400 --> 01:23:59,039
He'll be okay!

881
01:23:59,720 --> 01:24:00,719
Come on!

882
01:24:02,040 --> 01:24:02,719
My Bey.

883
01:24:08,000 --> 01:24:10,119
This will stop the bleeding.

884
01:24:10,920 --> 01:24:13,959
You'll be okay.

885
01:24:14,720 --> 01:24:16,319
My Bey.

886
01:24:16,440 --> 01:24:17,479
Tell me.

887
01:24:17,520 --> 01:24:18,919
Tell me Cerkutay Bey.

888
01:24:19,320 --> 01:24:21,999
Bey save yourself.

889
01:24:25,760 --> 01:24:29,039
My Bey. They’re after you!

890
01:24:29,360 --> 01:24:30,119
Tell me.

891
01:24:30,360 --> 01:24:32,039
Where's my father?

892
01:24:37,160 --> 01:24:38,159
Yildiz....

893
01:24:39,680 --> 01:24:40,799
Yildiz Cave?

894
01:24:46,040 --> 01:24:48,359
Don't tire yourself Cerkutay Bey.

895
01:24:48,600 --> 01:24:49,919
Don't tire yourself.

896
01:24:49,920 --> 01:24:50,879
Baysungur.
-Shehzade?

897
01:24:50,880 --> 01:24:53,719
Take Cerkitay Bey to the tribe.

898
01:24:53,840 --> 01:24:55,719
Alaeddin will help him Allah willing.

899
01:24:55,720 --> 01:24:57,359
Take him. Keep pressure on the wound.

900
01:24:57,360 --> 01:24:58,399
As you wish my Shehzade.

901
01:24:58,880 --> 01:25:00,839
Come on.

902
01:25:00,840 --> 01:25:01,999
In the name of Allah.
-Brother.

903
01:25:02,120 --> 01:25:03,239
You'll be okay.

904
01:25:03,240 --> 01:25:05,359
Cerkutay doesn't die!
Cerkutay doesn't die!

905
01:25:05,960 --> 01:25:07,079
Cerkutay!

906
01:25:07,760 --> 01:25:09,079
Hang on brother.

907
01:25:09,560 --> 01:25:11,079
You'll be okay. You'll be okay.

908
01:25:11,200 --> 01:25:13,079
Cerkutay.

909
01:25:13,200 --> 01:25:14,799
Hang on brother.

910
01:25:15,000 --> 01:25:16,799
You'll be okay. You’ll be okay.

911
01:25:52,440 --> 01:25:53,319
My Bey.

912
01:25:55,160 --> 01:25:56,199
Father!

913
01:25:56,200 --> 01:25:58,199
Osman Bey!

914
01:26:01,760 --> 01:26:02,919
Osman Bey isn't here.

915
01:26:03,400 --> 01:26:06,639
He killed these dogs and kept moving.

916
01:26:06,840 --> 01:26:07,879
Father!

917
01:26:16,480 --> 01:26:17,759
Shehzade.

918
01:26:18,040 --> 01:26:19,359
My Bey's sword.

919
01:26:37,560 --> 01:26:39,839
They dragged my Bey with a horse.

920
01:26:40,960 --> 01:26:42,799
Then he dropped his sword.

921
01:26:43,560 --> 01:26:44,999
Allah protect my Bey.

922
01:26:52,280 --> 01:26:53,919
What if Osman Bey died?

923
01:26:53,920 --> 01:26:54,919
Shut up!

924
01:26:56,720 --> 01:26:57,879
Get it together.

925
01:26:58,320 --> 01:27:00,679
My father won't easily die!

926
01:27:03,880 --> 01:27:05,359
We’ll follow the trail.

927
01:27:05,360 --> 01:27:07,359
We’ll find Osman Bey. Come on!

928
01:27:23,040 --> 01:27:25,119
Shehzade Alaeddin!

929
01:27:25,120 --> 01:27:26,119
Come on.
-Baysungur.

930
01:27:26,120 --> 01:27:27,919
Cerkutay’s wounded.

931
01:27:28,000 --> 01:27:29,199
Cerkutay!

932
01:27:29,680 --> 01:27:31,039
He'll be okay.

933
01:27:31,040 --> 01:27:32,399
Shehzade!

934
01:27:32,400 --> 01:27:34,399
Alps!
-Shehzade Alaeddin!

935
01:27:34,480 --> 01:27:36,919
Cerkutay Bey!

936
01:27:36,920 --> 01:27:39,759
Hang on!
-Carry him!

937
01:27:39,760 --> 01:27:41,079
Ulgen.

938
01:27:41,640 --> 01:27:42,349
Father

939
01:27:42,349 --> 01:27:43,759
-Ghazi.
-Don't leave us.

940
01:27:43,760 --> 01:27:45,439
He's gone...

941
01:27:45,440 --> 01:27:47,039
My bey...

942
01:27:47,040 --> 01:27:49,159
My bey is gone...

943
01:27:49,320 --> 01:27:50,519
Osman.

944
01:27:53,080 --> 01:27:55,279
My bey...

945
01:27:56,680 --> 01:28:00,599
Boil water quickly. Come on.

946
01:28:01,320 --> 01:28:02,799
Ghazi.

947
01:28:02,800 --> 01:28:03,839
Father

948
01:28:04,280 --> 01:28:06,039
I'm with you.

949
01:28:06,640 --> 01:28:08,439
Hold on Cerkutay Bey.

950
01:28:08,440 --> 01:28:09,919
Take him to infirmary quickly.

951
01:28:09,920 --> 01:28:11,479
-My Shahzade.
-Come on.

952
01:28:11,480 --> 01:28:13,239
Heal my father.

953
01:28:13,240 --> 01:28:16,079
-Heal him.
-He's going to be okay.

954
01:28:16,080 --> 01:28:17,399
Stand straight.

955
01:28:17,400 --> 01:28:19,799
I promise you, I'm going to heal him okay?

956
01:28:19,800 --> 01:28:21,239
Come on.

957
01:28:28,920 --> 01:28:30,559
Orhan.

958
01:28:33,720 --> 01:28:35,199
Thank Allah, you're okay.

959
01:28:35,200 --> 01:28:37,799
We’re okay, Alhamdulillah mother Bala.

960
01:28:40,840 --> 01:28:43,759
Son, your father. Where is Osman Bey?

961
01:28:43,760 --> 01:28:44,839
My father.

962
01:28:44,840 --> 01:28:46,799
He's not here mother Bala.

963
01:28:46,800 --> 01:28:50,359
We followed the trails, they
dragged him with a horse.

964
01:28:52,880 --> 01:28:55,719
But we will find him with Allah’s permission.

965
01:28:55,960 --> 01:28:58,879
We will.

966
01:28:59,080 --> 01:29:01,959
Where did you go?
Where should we go now?

967
01:29:01,960 --> 01:29:03,759
We came from this way, Bala Hatun.

968
01:29:03,760 --> 01:29:06,359
But the trail goes that way.

969
01:29:06,480 --> 01:29:08,879
Okay, we'll separate then.

970
01:29:08,880 --> 01:29:11,319
You go there, we will go this way.

971
01:29:11,320 --> 01:29:12,879
One who finds him should shoot an whistle arrow.

972
01:29:12,880 --> 01:29:14,359
Okay, come on son.

973
01:29:15,000 --> 01:29:16,239
Come on.

974
01:29:16,920 --> 01:29:18,279
Come on.

975
01:29:53,760 --> 01:29:55,319
Iltutan?

976
01:29:57,960 --> 01:29:59,519
Osman.

977
01:30:08,480 --> 01:30:10,039
Son.

978
01:30:10,040 --> 01:30:12,879
Iltutan, what happened son?

979
01:30:16,000 --> 01:30:17,559
Son.

980
01:30:22,200 --> 01:30:24,039
Stop son.

981
01:30:24,360 --> 01:30:26,479
Are you looking for Osman Bey too?

982
01:30:26,480 --> 01:30:27,599
Son?

983
01:30:27,600 --> 01:30:29,959
Where is Osman Bey?

984
01:30:30,200 --> 01:30:32,279
Where is he?

985
01:30:34,000 --> 01:30:37,039
Okay, son okay we'll find him. Come on.

986
01:30:37,200 --> 01:30:39,799
Come on, take me to him. Come on.

987
01:30:40,000 --> 01:30:41,759
Come on. Allah..

988
01:30:41,760 --> 01:30:44,519
Allah, spare him.. Come on son.

989
01:30:44,520 --> 01:30:46,719
Come on, to your horses.

990
01:30:49,040 --> 01:30:50,919
Come on.

991
01:30:55,600 --> 01:30:57,759
Come on lltutan.

992
01:30:58,160 --> 01:31:00,599
Come on son.

993
01:31:26,160 --> 01:31:27,679
Osman.

994
01:31:28,480 --> 01:31:30,839
My bey. Osman.

995
01:31:31,920 --> 01:31:33,459
Osman.

996
01:31:42,360 --> 01:31:46,119
He's alive. You're alive thank Allah.

997
01:31:47,200 --> 01:31:48,839
Take it off, slowly.

998
01:31:49,040 --> 01:31:50,759
Slowly.

999
01:31:50,760 --> 01:31:51,919
My bey.

1000
01:31:51,920 --> 01:31:53,719
Osman...Slow.

1001
01:31:53,880 --> 01:31:56,399
Thank Allah.

1002
01:31:57,440 --> 01:31:59,039
Bring water, come on.

1003
01:31:59,040 --> 01:32:01,279
Water...Osman...

1004
01:32:04,760 --> 01:32:06,079
Osman.

1005
01:32:11,280 --> 01:32:13,599
Are you okay?

1006
01:32:13,600 --> 01:32:15,319
I'm okay.

1007
01:32:16,600 --> 01:32:18,399
I'm okay...

1008
01:32:22,000 --> 01:32:23,999
Orhan.

1009
01:32:24,120 --> 01:32:25,519
Alps.

1010
01:32:25,920 --> 01:32:27,079
How are they?

1011
01:32:27,080 --> 01:32:28,879
They are all okay.

1012
01:32:28,880 --> 01:32:30,239
Don't worry.

1013
01:32:36,080 --> 01:32:37,999
If everyone is okay...

1014
01:32:38,320 --> 01:32:40,279
...then why are you crying?

1015
01:32:41,920 --> 01:32:45,199
Why are you crying? I told you.

1016
01:32:45,440 --> 01:32:48,079
You can't get rid of me easily.

1017
01:32:48,080 --> 01:32:51,279
Well, who wants to get rid of you, huh?

1018
01:32:51,720 --> 01:32:55,999
But you love scaring us. You scared us again.

1019
01:33:10,000 --> 01:33:14,279
Thank Allah your armor protected
you. But you are wounded.

1020
01:33:18,120 --> 01:33:20,519
Well, Allah has helped me survive.

1021
01:33:20,720 --> 01:33:23,159
But we defeated Imren.

1022
01:33:23,240 --> 01:33:26,879
Bala, there is a traitor among us.

1023
01:33:27,240 --> 01:33:29,919
He exposed us.

1024
01:33:30,920 --> 01:33:33,639
We will find the traitor, my Bey.

1025
01:33:33,720 --> 01:33:37,119
Like the first day.

1026
01:33:37,280 --> 01:33:39,639
You saved me.

1027
01:33:39,840 --> 01:33:43,879
The first time I saw you, you
were a Bey’s son, covered in mud.

1028
01:33:44,160 --> 01:33:47,199
Now you are covered in mud again...

1029
01:33:47,280 --> 01:33:49,399
...but we have tall children.

1030
01:33:49,400 --> 01:33:51,679
Like the first day.

1031
01:33:52,880 --> 01:33:55,439
Your smile is still the same.

1032
01:34:01,280 --> 01:34:02,319
Osman.

1033
01:34:02,320 --> 01:34:03,879
They are coming.

1034
01:34:07,000 --> 01:34:08,959
Come on.

1035
01:34:17,200 --> 01:34:19,399
Come on, Bala.

1036
01:34:26,280 --> 01:34:29,359
Bala, we talked about the past.

1037
01:34:29,520 --> 01:34:31,439
Now the history repeats itself, huh?

1038
01:34:31,440 --> 01:34:33,679
That's right.

1039
01:34:35,160 --> 01:34:37,199
That's right.

1040
01:34:39,040 --> 01:34:40,639
Come here!

1041
01:35:24,800 --> 01:35:26,879
-Are you okay Bala?
-Yeah.

1042
01:35:30,280 --> 01:35:31,559
Okay.

1043
01:35:35,760 --> 01:35:38,879
-Son.
-My Bey!

1044
01:35:40,560 --> 01:35:42,599
My Bey.

1045
01:35:46,600 --> 01:35:47,759
Are you okay?

1046
01:35:47,760 --> 01:35:50,079
-I am okay, don’t worry.
-Thank Allah.

1047
01:35:51,920 --> 01:35:53,879
Osman Bey.

1048
01:35:58,040 --> 01:35:59,759
Where is Cerkutay?

1049
01:35:59,760 --> 01:36:02,159
My Bey, Cerkutay Bey is heavily wounded.

1050
01:36:02,160 --> 01:36:03,999
We sent him to the tribe to get treated.

1051
01:36:06,200 --> 01:36:08,279
Don't let anything happen to Cerkutay.

1052
01:36:08,320 --> 01:36:13,079
If it’s not Cerkutay, then who saved you?

1053
01:36:13,160 --> 01:36:15,039
Mehmet Bey.

1054
01:36:17,440 --> 01:36:20,359
It would be really tough for
us if he had not come in time.

1055
01:36:21,320 --> 01:36:24,599
Thank you, thank you Mehmet Bey.

1056
01:36:24,600 --> 01:36:26,119
Thank you.

1057
01:36:26,640 --> 01:36:29,039
Prepare your alps.

1058
01:36:29,160 --> 01:36:31,239
We will take the border market.

1059
01:36:31,400 --> 01:36:34,479
Thank you Osman Bey, it's about time.

1060
01:36:35,880 --> 01:36:39,319
Osman Bey, someone was protecting us.

1061
01:36:40,640 --> 01:36:44,519
It’s obvious who it was. Boran.

1062
01:36:44,800 --> 01:36:48,799
Even exile did not stop him. He acts alone.

1063
01:36:49,000 --> 01:36:51,919
We will see. Lets go.

1064
01:36:52,200 --> 01:36:54,039
Come on.

1065
01:36:57,360 --> 01:37:00,279
Peace be with you Boran Bey.

1066
01:37:01,440 --> 01:37:03,199
Peace be upon you.

1067
01:37:03,680 --> 01:37:06,759
You look like you return from defeat. What's wrong?

1068
01:37:07,760 --> 01:37:09,879
You see through me Yunus Emre.

1069
01:37:10,720 --> 01:37:12,039
You're right.

1070
01:37:13,080 --> 01:37:14,199
It was a defeat.

1071
01:37:17,040 --> 01:37:18,839
It was such a big defeat...

1072
01:37:21,840 --> 01:37:23,719
...that my enemy's defeated...

1073
01:37:24,080 --> 01:37:25,719
...and so am I.

1074
01:37:26,680 --> 01:37:27,999
The infidel..

1075
01:37:28,880 --> 01:37:30,359
...can cut through skin.

1076
01:37:31,760 --> 01:37:35,599
But a fight with a brother injured the soul.

1077
01:37:37,600 --> 01:37:38,759
Brother...

1078
01:37:41,400 --> 01:37:43,439
The man I call my brother...

1079
01:37:43,640 --> 01:37:45,439
...angered me so much.

1080
01:37:45,720 --> 01:37:47,439
He talked bad about my service.

1081
01:37:48,440 --> 01:37:49,799
I couldn't help it.

1082
01:37:53,000 --> 01:37:55,439
I am...
-You are...

1083
01:37:55,680 --> 01:37:58,479
...Osman Bey's closest man...

1084
01:37:59,320 --> 01:38:01,079
...his most loyal man.

1085
01:38:03,280 --> 01:38:05,679
What he said hurt you.

1086
01:38:06,280 --> 01:38:08,239
And if you never said a word back...

1087
01:38:09,240 --> 01:38:11,239
...you'd be uncomfortable.

1088
01:38:11,920 --> 01:38:13,679
You didn’t want to look weak.

1089
01:38:14,280 --> 01:38:16,999
And you thought 'Who is he that he can say it?'

1090
01:38:21,600 --> 01:38:23,279
This is arrogance.

1091
01:38:23,720 --> 01:38:25,279
Arrogance and anger...

1092
01:38:26,560 --> 01:38:28,959
...confuses man's mind...

1093
01:38:29,040 --> 01:38:30,199
...and makes him...

1094
01:38:30,440 --> 01:38:34,359
...face many troubles in the end.

1095
01:38:37,440 --> 01:38:38,719
One time..

1096
01:38:39,240 --> 01:38:41,839
...you asked of Omer Hadrath's anger.

1097
01:38:42,360 --> 01:38:46,439
I told you. Now I can tell you...

1098
01:38:47,040 --> 01:38:50,319
...about his justice and how
he quieted his arrogance.

1099
01:38:50,320 --> 01:38:51,959
Would you want that Boran Bey?

1100
01:38:54,720 --> 01:38:55,959
Omer Hadrath..

1101
01:38:56,400 --> 01:38:58,519
...during his caliph era...

1102
01:38:58,600 --> 01:39:00,479
...asked his people in khutbe.

1103
01:39:01,680 --> 01:39:03,119
’If I left Allah's word...

1104
01:39:03,520 --> 01:39:04,799
..what would you do?'

1105
01:39:06,160 --> 01:39:08,879
A companion answered him.

1106
01:39:09,760 --> 01:39:13,439
Td fix you with my sword, Omer.'

1107
01:39:16,200 --> 01:39:18,519
Omer Hadrath was happy to hear it.

1108
01:39:18,920 --> 01:39:20,519
He opened his hands...

1109
01:39:21,520 --> 01:39:22,719
...and tells Allah...

1110
01:39:23,040 --> 01:39:24,479
...'Allah...

1111
01:39:25,160 --> 01:39:27,079
...thank You...

1112
01:39:27,520 --> 01:39:30,119
...for if I ever forget Your Word...

1113
01:39:30,120 --> 01:39:32,119
...and ignore Your Justice..

1114
01:39:32,600 --> 01:39:35,119
...there are people who'll
fix me with their sword.'

1115
01:39:38,800 --> 01:39:41,439
Men will make mistakes.

1116
01:39:42,200 --> 01:39:44,639
But what matters is to see the truth...

1117
01:39:45,040 --> 01:39:46,639
...and make amends.

1118
01:39:47,480 --> 01:39:50,199
Say Tawba...

1119
01:39:50,480 --> 01:39:52,199
...and wait for forgiveness.

1120
01:39:53,400 --> 01:39:54,199
Now you said...

1121
01:39:54,640 --> 01:39:57,199
...the fight had no victor.

1122
01:39:59,320 --> 01:40:01,239
Anger and arrogance...

1123
01:40:01,480 --> 01:40:04,719
...defeated you and your brother.

1124
01:40:06,000 --> 01:40:07,999
If you don't let you of arrogance...

1125
01:40:08,920 --> 01:40:11,439
...and prioritize your brother...

1126
01:40:15,360 --> 01:40:17,279
...the fight's victor will never change.

1127
01:40:21,400 --> 01:40:24,359
GERMIYANOGLU BORDER - FRONTIER MARKET

1128
01:40:27,120 --> 01:40:29,839
It's your fault our innocent
soldiers died Imren Tegin.

1129
01:40:30,280 --> 01:40:31,839
How could you be fooled?

1130
01:40:35,480 --> 01:40:37,399
Everything will be okay Cardinal.

1131
01:40:37,680 --> 01:40:38,599
How will that be?

1132
01:40:48,600 --> 01:40:49,639
Imren Tegin.

1133
01:40:49,840 --> 01:40:51,639
Osman is alive.

1134
01:40:52,080 --> 01:40:53,639
He's going to his tribe.

1135
01:40:59,800 --> 01:41:01,519
You made a big mistake.

1136
01:41:01,720 --> 01:41:02,839
We lost.

1137
01:41:03,600 --> 01:41:05,159
You trusted Osman.

1138
01:41:05,440 --> 01:41:07,159
And you paid...
-Enough!

1139
01:41:14,800 --> 01:41:17,439
I'll give you everything I promised Cardinal.

1140
01:41:17,680 --> 01:41:18,879
Despite Osman?

1141
01:41:18,880 --> 01:41:20,439
Despite Osman.

1142
01:41:25,880 --> 01:41:27,239
I'll use Gunduz.

1143
01:41:28,880 --> 01:41:31,319
Osman can only be defeated by his loved ones.

1144
01:41:31,640 --> 01:41:32,719
I saw it.

1145
01:41:33,560 --> 01:41:35,239
So I'll take Gunduz.

1146
01:41:36,520 --> 01:41:38,399
Then I'll have my relics.

1147
01:41:39,320 --> 01:41:41,879
And I'll stop the two tribes uniting.

1148
01:41:47,040 --> 01:41:47,879
Imren Tegin.

1149
01:41:48,920 --> 01:41:50,079
Commander Konur Bey.

1150
01:41:50,360 --> 01:41:52,079
He was seen at the Yenisehir inn.

1151
01:41:54,680 --> 01:41:55,799
Good.

1152
01:41:56,360 --> 01:41:57,799
Konur and I share blood.

1153
01:41:59,120 --> 01:42:00,799
He's of Seljuk blood.

1154
01:42:01,680 --> 01:42:04,559
Do whatever you have to do and make him join us.

1155
01:42:04,680 --> 01:42:07,519
I'm going to land a hit on
Osman from this side too.

1156
01:42:13,760 --> 01:42:15,719
We made a mistake Holofira Hatun.

1157
01:42:15,720 --> 01:42:17,439
Let's go back before anyone sees us.

1158
01:42:17,440 --> 01:42:19,119
If someone sees us..

1159
01:42:19,120 --> 01:42:21,319
I know it's very dangerous Kismet.

1160
01:42:21,320 --> 01:42:23,959
But I can't just wait while Orhan is in danger.

1161
01:42:23,960 --> 01:42:26,399
I have to find out what happened.

1162
01:42:27,680 --> 01:42:30,279
Osman Bey is coming.

1163
01:42:45,160 --> 01:42:47,079
Welcome my bey.

1164
01:42:50,880 --> 01:42:52,079
Thank you.

1165
01:42:52,880 --> 01:42:53,959
Thank you.

1166
01:42:57,040 --> 01:42:59,839
-Allah spared you my bey.
-Get well soon my bey.

1167
01:42:59,840 --> 01:43:00,839
My bey.

1168
01:43:00,960 --> 01:43:02,679
Long live Osman Bey.

1169
01:43:02,720 --> 01:43:05,199
-Get well soon Osman Bey.
-Welcome my bey.

1170
01:43:05,200 --> 01:43:07,439
Get well soon my bey.

1171
01:43:14,640 --> 01:43:15,879
Father

1172
01:43:17,240 --> 01:43:18,959
Son.

1173
01:43:22,840 --> 01:43:24,239
Are you okay?

1174
01:43:24,240 --> 01:43:27,319
I was so scared thinking
something might happen to you.

1175
01:43:27,440 --> 01:43:29,119
I'm okay.

1176
01:43:29,360 --> 01:43:31,959
I'm okay my beautiful daughter.

1177
01:43:36,960 --> 01:43:37,999
Are you okay?

1178
01:43:38,000 --> 01:43:39,599
I'm okay mother, thank Allah.

1179
01:43:39,600 --> 01:43:41,119
Don't worry.

1180
01:43:41,880 --> 01:43:44,239
Thank Allah.

1181
01:43:56,000 --> 01:43:58,759
Brother.

1182
01:44:02,040 --> 01:44:04,559
You're okay right?

1183
01:44:04,680 --> 01:44:08,319
-I’m okay don't worry.
-Thank Allah my bey.

1184
01:44:15,160 --> 01:44:17,079
Father, are you okay?

1185
01:44:18,040 --> 01:44:19,639
Son.

1186
01:44:20,000 --> 01:44:21,639
Tell me.

1187
01:44:21,880 --> 01:44:23,799
How is Cerkutay?

1188
01:44:23,840 --> 01:44:26,279
He lost a lot of blood, father.

1189
01:44:26,280 --> 01:44:27,759
I dressed his wound.

1190
01:44:27,760 --> 01:44:29,759
I hope he's going to be okay.

1191
01:44:31,680 --> 01:44:35,559
I hope so, I hope so.

1192
01:44:39,800 --> 01:44:40,879
Baykurt.

1193
01:44:40,880 --> 01:44:41,759
My bey.

1194
01:44:41,760 --> 01:44:44,439
Bury our martyrs.

1195
01:44:44,480 --> 01:44:46,279
Check up on Cerkutay too.

1196
01:44:46,280 --> 01:44:47,919
Tell him to see me when he's better.

1197
01:44:47,920 --> 01:44:49,559
As you wish my bey.

1198
01:44:51,880 --> 01:44:53,759
Come on.

1199
01:44:55,160 --> 01:44:57,079
Come on.

1200
01:45:10,120 --> 01:45:12,079
Holofira.

1201
01:45:17,320 --> 01:45:20,399
-Kismet we have to leave now.
-Holofira.

1202
01:45:20,920 --> 01:45:23,279
Holofira.

1203
01:45:33,320 --> 01:45:36,559
You risked so much coming here...

1204
01:45:36,720 --> 01:45:40,239
...but are you leaving without saying
a word to me, daughter of Tekfur?

1205
01:45:40,560 --> 01:45:43,159
I wanted to be sure that everyone was okay.

1206
01:45:43,160 --> 01:45:46,079
I was going to leave without seeing anyone.

1207
01:45:48,000 --> 01:45:50,799
Without being seen huh?

1208
01:45:51,960 --> 01:45:56,079
Which crowd can make blind
to your existence Holofira?

1209
01:45:56,320 --> 01:45:59,719
Even in pitch black darkness, I see your eyes.

1210
01:46:03,720 --> 01:46:05,759
Don't you know that?

1211
01:46:08,360 --> 01:46:11,999
God might have wanted us
to say goodbye one last time.

1212
01:46:16,320 --> 01:46:18,799
I loved you a lot.

1213
01:46:22,280 --> 01:46:23,999
I know you loved me too.

1214
01:46:24,000 --> 01:46:24,839
A lot.

1215
01:46:27,320 --> 01:46:30,199
I love you a lot too, daughter of Lord.

1216
01:46:34,960 --> 01:46:38,439
This love was a gift to us from God.

1217
01:46:40,640 --> 01:46:43,679
You won't be there anymore, yes...

1218
01:46:44,920 --> 01:46:49,039
...but this love will live
with me until my last breath.

1219
01:46:51,360 --> 01:46:53,679
Allah has written this in our...

1220
01:46:54,560 --> 01:46:56,719
...destiny instead of us being together...

1221
01:46:58,840 --> 01:47:01,999
If my heart is not shattered into pieces..

1222
01:47:02,880 --> 01:47:06,599
...it's because of my belief
in destiny, daughter of Tekfur.

1223
01:47:12,200 --> 01:47:14,879
Elcim Hatun is a good person.

1224
01:47:15,480 --> 01:47:19,119
She is fair. She is strong.

1225
01:47:23,880 --> 01:47:26,639
You will have children.

1226
01:47:30,960 --> 01:47:35,999
You will be a good Bey, and a good father.

1227
01:47:37,200 --> 01:47:39,279
You will be very happy.

1228
01:47:42,080 --> 01:47:44,359
And I will live knowing that.

1229
01:47:50,360 --> 01:47:52,439
Farewell now.

1230
01:47:55,600 --> 01:47:57,839
May your path be filled with roses.

1231
01:48:00,160 --> 01:48:02,919
May Allah protect you Lord's daughter.

1232
01:48:15,080 --> 01:48:16,719
Holofira.

1233
01:48:17,080 --> 01:48:18,879
Holofira!

1234
01:48:30,560 --> 01:48:33,279
I thought I was dreaming.

1235
01:48:33,800 --> 01:48:37,639
It’s you! You are alive!

1236
01:48:39,160 --> 01:48:42,599
Holofira! You are alive!

1237
01:48:43,520 --> 01:48:46,839
Gonca, no one can see me here.

1238
01:48:47,960 --> 01:48:50,239
I will tell you everything.

1239
01:49:01,040 --> 01:49:03,079
Thank you, I apprecite that.

1240
01:49:03,080 --> 01:49:04,679
Iftaar time is coming close.

1241
01:49:04,680 --> 01:49:05,759
May Allah accept.

1242
01:49:05,760 --> 01:49:07,279
Thanks.

1243
01:49:21,120 --> 01:49:23,639
I brought you Imren Tegin's regards.

1244
01:49:24,880 --> 01:49:27,279
If you excuse me, I have things to tell you.

1245
01:49:30,240 --> 01:49:33,559
Imren Tegin says that "Konur
Bey is from Seljuk lineage...

1246
01:49:33,720 --> 01:49:36,639
...and we are of the same blood."

1247
01:49:38,040 --> 01:49:40,519
Osman Bey was unfair to you.

1248
01:49:40,520 --> 01:49:45,399
Imren Tegin wants to see you by
his side to give you what’s your right.

1249
01:49:46,640 --> 01:49:48,639
What is it that's my right?

1250
01:49:48,840 --> 01:49:51,159
Imren Tegin will make you a commander.

1251
01:49:51,800 --> 01:49:55,799
When we take back Kite
castle, it will be your property.

1252
01:49:56,080 --> 01:50:00,239
But first you will come and
pledge loyalty to Imren Tegin.

1253
01:50:00,560 --> 01:50:03,519
You will take shelter in his castle, or...

1254
01:50:10,200 --> 01:50:17,959
There is no god but the one Allah!

1255
01:50:20,200 --> 01:50:24,079
Come on, in the name of Allah,
the merciful, the beneficent.

1256
01:50:24,320 --> 01:50:29,079
In the name of Allah, the merciful, the beneficent.

1257
01:50:33,080 --> 01:50:35,759
Go on, eat.

1258
01:50:37,320 --> 01:50:42,359
May Allah accept our fasting,
and the good deeds we do.

1259
01:50:42,520 --> 01:50:43,999
Amen.

1260
01:50:44,000 --> 01:50:49,719
May Allah help our family, those
who are in need, those who are sick...

1261
01:50:49,720 --> 01:50:51,119
...and to all Islam world.

1262
01:50:51,120 --> 01:50:53,919
May He treat them with His mercy.

1263
01:50:53,920 --> 01:50:54,919
Ameen, my Bey.

1264
01:50:54,920 --> 01:50:56,159
Ameen my Bey.

1265
01:50:56,280 --> 01:50:57,879
Come on.

1266
01:51:03,160 --> 01:51:07,079
The man of the tribe did his duty.

1267
01:51:08,400 --> 01:51:10,879
We defeated Catalans and Frenks.

1268
01:51:11,920 --> 01:51:15,159
We ruined Imren's plans. Now tell me.

1269
01:51:15,520 --> 01:51:19,039
What’s the situation with the dowry?

1270
01:51:19,160 --> 01:51:22,839
Well, despite some unpleasant
things, we prepared it.

1271
01:51:23,160 --> 01:51:25,439
We are taking care of what's necessary.

1272
01:51:25,440 --> 01:51:28,519
Before Boran Bey left, he sent
out messengers for the wedding.

1273
01:51:28,520 --> 01:51:32,239
As you said, we will accept
loyalty pledges as gifts.

1274
01:51:32,560 --> 01:51:35,759
Alright. We don't have much time left.

1275
01:51:35,800 --> 01:51:38,719
We don't have time, so...

1276
01:51:39,040 --> 01:51:40,999
...are the tents ready?

1277
01:51:41,160 --> 01:51:42,479
Yes, my Bey.

1278
01:51:42,480 --> 01:51:43,999
Thank you.

1279
01:51:44,520 --> 01:51:49,079
Let's take border bazaar tomorrow.
Then the ambassador and the Cardinal.

1280
01:51:49,280 --> 01:51:52,079
We will rid our lands from the infidels.

1281
01:51:52,080 --> 01:51:56,159
Then if Allah permits, we
will hold our wedding.

1282
01:51:56,800 --> 01:51:57,919
If Allah permits, my Bey.

1283
01:51:57,920 --> 01:51:59,639
Live long, Osman Bey.

1284
01:51:59,720 --> 01:52:01,759
You live long, too.

1285
01:52:01,880 --> 01:52:07,039
We will entrust the state that will
rule over the whole world, to you.

1286
01:52:13,000 --> 01:52:13,879
Enjoy.

1287
01:52:46,800 --> 01:52:48,559
I don't want it.

1288
01:52:50,000 --> 01:52:51,959
I don't want it.

1289
01:52:53,040 --> 01:52:53,719
Cerkutay?

1290
01:52:54,720 --> 01:52:55,919
Cerkutay?

1291
01:52:57,680 --> 01:52:58,119
I'm here.

1292
01:53:00,000 --> 01:53:01,279
Who are you?

1293
01:53:01,480 --> 01:53:03,399
Ulgen.

1294
01:53:04,080 --> 01:53:05,399
Houri?

1295
01:53:06,800 --> 01:53:07,879
Houri?

1296
01:53:09,520 --> 01:53:10,799
Do you still see Houri?

1297
01:53:12,600 --> 01:53:14,839
You're fighting for you life?

1298
01:53:14,840 --> 01:53:16,439
Get up! Get up!

1299
01:53:17,240 --> 01:53:20,279
Houri! Peace be with you.

1300
01:53:20,760 --> 01:53:21,439
What?

1301
01:53:21,880 --> 01:53:23,599
I'm Cerkutay.

1302
01:53:24,520 --> 01:53:26,959
Open your eyes I'll gauge them out Cerkutay.

1303
01:53:26,960 --> 01:53:28,959
I know you from somewhere.

1304
01:53:29,160 --> 01:53:30,599
Who is she? How do you know?

1305
01:53:30,600 --> 01:53:31,839
How?

1306
01:53:31,920 --> 01:53:32,759
Cerkutay!

1307
01:53:34,240 --> 01:53:36,239
You look so pretty.

1308
01:53:36,240 --> 01:53:37,239
You...

1309
01:53:37,440 --> 01:53:40,959
Cerkutay! Open your eyes! Now!

1310
01:53:41,240 --> 01:53:42,519
Praise be.

1311
01:53:42,680 --> 01:53:44,119
Praise be...

1312
01:53:44,120 --> 01:53:45,839
Cerkutay.
-Pretty.

1313
01:53:45,880 --> 01:53:48,599
I am your Hatun. I'll hit you

1314
01:53:48,600 --> 01:53:50,519
Ulgen.

1315
01:53:53,760 --> 01:53:57,959
You are prettier than all Houris.

1316
01:53:59,760 --> 01:54:03,119
I'll kill you myself. I'll do it.

1317
01:54:03,120 --> 01:54:04,039
Ulgen wait.

1318
01:54:04,040 --> 01:54:06,719
What? Who are those Houris?

1319
01:54:06,960 --> 01:54:09,359
I was dying. I almost died.

1320
01:54:09,360 --> 01:54:12,399
No you weren’t. I'll kill you Cerkutay. I'll do it.

1321
01:54:12,400 --> 01:54:14,039
Ulgen don't.
-Not yet!

1322
01:54:14,360 --> 01:54:15,479
Are you okay?

1323
01:54:16,440 --> 01:54:17,719
I'm okay.

1324
01:54:18,560 --> 01:54:21,159
I'm okay my Hatun.

1325
01:54:21,640 --> 01:54:23,759
Don't worry I'll be fine.

1326
01:54:24,560 --> 01:54:26,679
Cerkutay doesn't die.

1327
01:54:35,080 --> 01:54:38,759
Peace be with you.

1328
01:54:39,040 --> 01:54:40,839
Peace be upon you.

1329
01:54:41,280 --> 01:54:43,759
Welcome. Welcome.

1330
01:54:43,760 --> 01:54:45,559
You honored us.

1331
01:54:45,600 --> 01:54:48,759
The Sultan of words, Yunus Emre.

1332
01:54:49,840 --> 01:54:51,239
Thank you.

1333
01:54:52,160 --> 01:54:54,639
You asked to welcome us in your tribe.

1334
01:54:55,480 --> 01:54:56,959
And we came.

1335
01:54:57,760 --> 01:54:59,719
If you break hearts...

1336
01:55:00,840 --> 01:55:02,999
...the prayer won't be accepted.

1337
01:55:03,720 --> 01:55:05,359
May Allah unite us.

1338
01:55:05,720 --> 01:55:07,359
Ameen. Thank you.

1339
01:55:07,600 --> 01:55:10,039
Amen. Amen.

1340
01:55:10,360 --> 01:55:13,079
You survived many traps.

1341
01:55:13,440 --> 01:55:14,839
May Allah accept it.

1342
01:55:16,080 --> 01:55:17,879
Thanks, thanks.

1343
01:55:20,720 --> 01:55:22,719
Well. Alps.

1344
01:55:23,280 --> 01:55:26,639
Yunus Emre and Dervishes are tired.

1345
01:55:27,120 --> 01:55:31,799
Come on. Bring them sherbet and water.

1346
01:55:31,800 --> 01:55:33,199
Welcome them.

1347
01:55:34,000 --> 01:55:35,199
Osman Bey.

1348
01:55:36,560 --> 01:55:38,839
Sherbet wets the throat.

1349
01:55:39,000 --> 01:55:40,479
It flushes away.

1350
01:55:41,080 --> 01:55:41,999
We...

1351
01:55:43,280 --> 01:55:46,959
...wish to wet the eyes and the heart if Allah permits.

1352
01:55:48,160 --> 01:55:49,999
We'd like to offer you gifts first.

1353
01:55:50,680 --> 01:55:51,999
Alright, alright.

1354
01:55:54,080 --> 01:55:55,879
Then welcome.

1355
01:56:28,560 --> 01:56:31,799
Know that there is no god but Allah.

1356
01:56:32,800 --> 01:56:48,799
There is no god but Allah.

1357
01:57:14,400 --> 01:57:17,599
There is no god but Allah.

1358
01:57:17,600 --> 01:57:27,079
-There is no god but Allah.
- I don't need this body but this soul...

1359
01:57:27,080 --> 01:57:36,599
-You need belief for the hereafter...
-There is no god but Allah.

1360
01:57:36,600 --> 01:57:39,519
There is no god but Allah.

1361
01:57:39,520 --> 01:57:49,079
-If you become one of Mohammed's ummah....
-There is no god but Allah.

1362
01:57:49,080 --> 01:58:01,599
-...you need speak about dhikr and Quran...
-There is no god but Allah.

1363
01:58:01,600 --> 01:58:17,159
-Yunus who is filled with love...
-There is no god but Allah.

1364
01:58:17,160 --> 01:58:32,439
There is no god but Allah.

1365
01:58:32,480 --> 01:58:36,879
-Yunus who is filled with love...
-There is no god but Allah.

1366
01:58:39,320 --> 01:58:48,599
-It has no meaning without you...
-There is no god but Allah.

1367
01:59:07,560 --> 02:00:04,279
There is no god but Allah.

1368
02:00:47,600 --> 02:00:49,759
There's a crowd out there.

1369
02:00:49,760 --> 02:00:53,039
People are coming in. It's just the time to leave.

1370
02:00:53,440 --> 02:00:54,879
Let's go.

1371
02:01:03,200 --> 02:01:05,999
I know about everything you did Olivia.

1372
02:01:06,200 --> 02:01:07,679
Is that so?

1373
02:01:07,960 --> 02:01:09,919
What did I do?

1374
02:01:09,920 --> 02:01:13,159
Don't be scared. I didn't come
here to make you confess.

1375
02:01:13,520 --> 02:01:15,999
After all, we both
want the same thing.

1376
02:01:18,160 --> 02:01:21,119
You're making me more curious.

1377
02:01:21,760 --> 02:01:25,599
Elcim and Orhan won't get married.

1378
02:01:26,080 --> 02:01:28,959
We will act together for this.

1379
02:01:31,440 --> 02:01:34,719
You're smarter than I thought you were.

1380
02:01:39,520 --> 02:01:41,359
For Holofira.

1381
02:01:49,200 --> 02:01:50,719
Stupid.

1382
02:01:50,720 --> 02:01:53,639
You can't even be my maid.

1383
02:01:54,760 --> 02:01:57,399
Now, we can go.

1384
02:02:00,720 --> 02:02:06,319
Great, Gracious Allah..

1385
02:02:06,520 --> 02:02:10,359
...bless Osman Bey and his army who have united...

1386
02:02:10,400 --> 02:02:14,105
...their hearts for
the fight of Islam, with

1387
02:02:14,117 --> 02:02:17,999
many victories just as
they were blessed today.

1388
02:02:18,000 --> 02:02:20,119
Amen.

1389
02:02:20,880 --> 02:02:23,759
Give them the power to
crush the heads of the Shirks.

1390
02:02:23,760 --> 02:02:25,399
Ameen.

1391
02:02:25,400 --> 02:02:31,839
For the sake of the martyrs
who died for the path...

1392
02:02:32,400 --> 02:02:39,099
...of Allah, and for Islam world, make
us followers of our prophet.

1393
02:02:39,360 --> 02:02:40,959
Amen.

1394
02:02:45,000 --> 02:02:48,359
Don't let us lose the righteous path.

1395
02:02:48,360 --> 02:02:49,999
Amen.

1396
02:02:50,120 --> 02:02:53,959
Allow us to took shelter in Allah against...

1397
02:02:54,120 --> 02:02:57,679
...the people who tries to bring fitna among us.

1398
02:02:57,680 --> 02:02:59,399
Amen.

1399
02:02:59,560 --> 02:03:07,039
Oh Allah, allow the followers of
Mohammad to always have unity.

1400
02:03:07,200 --> 02:03:09,079
Amen.

1401
02:03:09,240 --> 02:03:16,159
Allow Osman Bey and his family
to carry the flag of our cause!

1402
02:03:16,160 --> 02:03:18,159
Amen.

1403
02:03:19,200 --> 02:03:21,439
Ameen.

1404
02:03:22,360 --> 02:03:24,559
Al Fatiha.

1405
02:03:24,560 --> 02:03:34,319
Oh Allah, glorify our prophet PBUH and his lineage!

1406
02:04:11,480 --> 02:04:14,559
Brother Hasan, they are going to runaway.

1407
02:04:14,720 --> 02:04:16,559
Inform shahzade.

1408
02:04:16,560 --> 02:04:18,959
I will leave marks on the path. Follow it.

1409
02:04:18,960 --> 02:04:19,679
Come on.

1410
02:04:19,680 --> 02:04:21,519
Thank you Oguz.

1411
02:04:25,120 --> 02:04:28,039
I hope this home will bring us peace.

1412
02:04:28,200 --> 02:04:29,199
I hope so.

1413
02:04:29,200 --> 02:04:31,399
Can I come in, Elcim Hatun?

1414
02:04:32,120 --> 02:04:34,879
Come in Orhan Bey.

1415
02:04:38,200 --> 02:04:40,159
Oh, praise be.

1416
02:04:44,080 --> 02:04:47,519
I came to see how you are.

1417
02:04:48,200 --> 02:04:52,319
I am fine. We were finishing last things.

1418
02:04:52,640 --> 02:04:55,559
The wedding is getting close,
we wanted to wrap things up.

1419
02:04:55,560 --> 02:04:57,079
You thought well.

1420
02:05:01,840 --> 02:05:06,039
I heard what you did for Gazi. You
jumped into the fire without hesitation.

1421
02:05:06,400 --> 02:05:07,959
Thank you.

1422
02:05:08,360 --> 02:05:09,799
You got wounded too.

1423
02:05:09,920 --> 02:05:11,879
This wound is nothing, Orhan Bey.

1424
02:05:11,880 --> 02:05:12,999
Yeah.

1425
02:05:13,080 --> 02:05:15,679
You will start talking about being a tribes girl.

1426
02:05:15,680 --> 02:05:19,199
But look, we are all in a tribe now.

1427
02:05:21,920 --> 02:05:24,519
You are in our care, Elcim Hatun.

1428
02:05:26,040 --> 02:05:28,679
I wouldn't want to be
embarrassed in front of your father.

1429
02:05:29,920 --> 02:05:32,679
My father knows that this is my tribe now.

1430
02:05:32,680 --> 02:05:36,319
Every life in the tribe is important for me.

1431
02:05:38,720 --> 02:05:41,839
I did what was necessary.
And I will continue to do so.

1432
02:05:43,600 --> 02:05:45,319
Thank you.

1433
02:05:46,200 --> 02:05:48,239
Can I come in, my shahzade?

1434
02:05:48,240 --> 02:05:50,279
Come in.

1435
02:05:53,880 --> 02:05:58,079
My shahzade, Olivia was going towards
the horses. They are gping to escape.

1436
02:05:58,440 --> 02:06:01,359
Oguz alp is following them to leave us marks.

1437
02:06:01,360 --> 02:06:03,519
We will let them escape.

1438
02:06:03,720 --> 02:06:05,679
They will think we did not realize it.

1439
02:06:05,680 --> 02:06:08,079
We will follow them..

1440
02:06:08,560 --> 02:06:11,519
...and learn the location of the secret passages.

1441
02:06:11,520 --> 02:06:15,159
I am coming too. I senses there
was something wrong with that Hatun.

1442
02:06:15,160 --> 02:06:16,959
And after what happened to my sister...

1443
02:06:16,960 --> 02:06:19,119
Don't get tired at this hour, Elcim hatun.

1444
02:06:19,120 --> 02:06:20,799
I am coming, Orhan Bey.

1445
02:06:20,800 --> 02:06:22,319
I am.

1446
02:06:24,040 --> 02:06:26,399
Who am I talking to?

1447
02:06:28,800 --> 02:06:31,839
Hasan, send word to alps.

1448
02:06:32,000 --> 02:06:33,799
Tell them to inform my father.

1449
02:06:33,800 --> 02:06:35,439
As you command my Shahzade.

1450
02:06:35,560 --> 02:06:38,559
Come on, in the name of Allah.

1451
02:06:43,520 --> 02:06:46,519
Kite area.

1452
02:06:58,920 --> 02:07:01,439
Where are you going Gunduz Bey?

1453
02:07:02,280 --> 02:07:06,119
I was coming to take your life, you dog!

1454
02:07:06,680 --> 02:07:10,319
Really? You talk too big for yourself.

1455
02:07:10,480 --> 02:07:13,759
I haven’t finished yet.

1456
02:07:14,520 --> 02:07:19,119
I am going to kill you and
hang your head on Kite castle.

1457
02:07:22,600 --> 02:07:24,839
Alps!

1458
02:07:50,880 --> 02:07:53,799
Not even your trusted Bey
Osman can take you from me.

1459
02:07:54,200 --> 02:07:56,199
Those who rule with cruelty...

1460
02:07:56,600 --> 02:07:58,199
....will have a miserable fate.

1461
02:07:59,240 --> 02:08:01,839
You'll end up dead too.

1462
02:08:09,360 --> 02:08:11,679
You're more important alive than dead.

1463
02:08:19,880 --> 02:08:22,399
Tell Osman I have Gunduz.

1464
02:08:23,360 --> 02:08:24,839
Now I have you Osman.

1465
02:08:28,160 --> 02:08:31,519
This is how we'll take control of border bazaar.

1466
02:08:33,000 --> 02:08:35,199
Gonca Hatun says..

1467
02:08:35,520 --> 02:08:38,279
...that Border Bazaar has some weaknesses.

1468
02:08:38,400 --> 02:08:40,079
Mehmet Bey said the same.

1469
02:08:40,200 --> 02:08:43,679
He behind these walls are some passage ways.

1470
02:08:45,400 --> 02:08:46,879
But..

1471
02:08:48,360 --> 02:08:51,199
...Imren must have reinforced them.

1472
02:08:51,200 --> 02:08:53,199
He increased watchers.

1473
02:08:54,520 --> 02:08:57,359
Is it just for the cardinal and the messenger?

1474
02:08:59,200 --> 02:09:00,439
Imren thinks...

1475
02:09:01,040 --> 02:09:02,639
...that the border bazaar...

1476
02:09:03,320 --> 02:09:05,439
...must be the base of crusaders.

1477
02:09:06,960 --> 02:09:10,319
Olcaytu's gold is in Border Bazaar.

1478
02:09:11,880 --> 02:09:14,319
That's why, Alaeddin Bey...

1479
02:09:15,000 --> 02:09:17,359
...Bala Hatun, Gonca Hatun...

1480
02:09:18,200 --> 02:09:20,439
....will go to scout the bazaar.

1481
02:09:21,520 --> 02:09:23,359
You'll see all the precautions.

1482
02:09:23,360 --> 02:09:26,719
Watch the guards and count them.

1483
02:09:27,480 --> 02:09:29,119
As you wish my Bey.

1484
02:09:30,840 --> 02:09:32,319
Then...

1485
02:09:32,800 --> 02:09:34,719
...we’ll take border bazaar...

1486
02:09:35,240 --> 02:09:36,719
...and the gold.

1487
02:09:38,400 --> 02:09:40,879
Tell Mehmet Bey to gather his Alps.

1488
02:09:41,320 --> 02:09:42,879
He'll meet us there.

1489
02:09:45,040 --> 02:09:48,359
Today is the last day of Turk's hospitality.

1490
02:09:48,920 --> 02:09:50,359
May Allah help us.

1491
02:09:50,680 --> 02:09:51,639
Amen.

1492
02:09:51,960 --> 02:09:53,359
Ameen my Bey.

1493
02:10:01,480 --> 02:10:03,599
You should have stayed at the tribe Hatun.

1494
02:10:03,720 --> 02:10:05,359
We rode horse all night long.

1495
02:10:06,000 --> 02:10:07,359
Why should I?

1496
02:10:07,800 --> 02:10:09,359
He's my enemy too.

1497
02:10:09,720 --> 02:10:11,359
was being kind.

1498
02:10:11,760 --> 02:10:13,359
I don't want you to be tired.

1499
02:10:14,120 --> 02:10:16,159
You should've stayed if you're tired.

1500
02:10:16,200 --> 02:10:17,439
I would come alone.

1501
02:10:17,440 --> 02:10:18,999
Allah help me.

1502
02:10:19,000 --> 02:10:20,999
You're such a stubborn Hatun.

1503
02:10:22,440 --> 02:10:24,319
You don't know me yet.

1504
02:10:25,520 --> 02:10:26,279
But..

1505
02:10:27,360 --> 02:10:28,639
..I don’t know you either.

1506
02:10:30,520 --> 02:10:31,799
We’ll meet Elcim Hatun.

1507
02:10:32,800 --> 02:10:34,759
We’ll have a lot of time for it.

1508
02:10:36,120 --> 02:10:36,879
Come on.

1509
02:11:02,280 --> 02:11:04,159
We’ll continue on foot from now on.

1510
02:11:05,880 --> 02:11:07,039
Tie up the horses Hasan.

1511
02:11:43,000 --> 02:11:44,279
Whats the situation Oguz?

1512
02:11:44,760 --> 02:11:46,279
They went that way S'hehzade.

1513
02:11:51,960 --> 02:11:52,559
Let's go.

1514
02:12:13,440 --> 02:12:15,559
Olivia.

1515
02:12:15,640 --> 02:12:16,959
Her plan...

1516
02:12:17,840 --> 02:12:19,799
...will cost her Atranos.

1517
02:12:20,080 --> 02:12:20,959
I hope so.

1518
02:12:33,640 --> 02:12:37,159
Osman Bey says after we
take Atranos he will hold a feast.

1519
02:12:37,160 --> 02:12:38,919
We will.

1520
02:12:38,920 --> 02:12:41,439
With Allah's permission once we take Atranos...

1521
02:12:41,440 --> 02:12:45,039
...despite Imren Tegin,
two Kayi tribes will unite...

1522
02:12:45,160 --> 02:12:47,239
...and hold that feast.

1523
02:12:48,920 --> 02:12:50,479
Come on.

1524
02:12:57,960 --> 02:12:59,159
Someone's coming.

1525
02:12:59,160 --> 02:13:01,079
Come on.

1526
02:13:17,600 --> 02:13:19,359
Father

1527
02:13:24,160 --> 02:13:25,559
Father

1528
02:13:27,120 --> 02:13:28,439
Elcim Hatun.

1529
02:13:29,480 --> 02:13:29,959
Calm down. We’ll wait for the right time.

1530
02:13:29,960 --> 02:13:33,399
Calm down. We'll wait for the right time.

1531
02:13:35,240 --> 02:13:37,839
Shout all you want Gunduz Bey.

1532
02:13:37,840 --> 02:13:41,039
No one can hear you here.

1533
02:13:41,200 --> 02:13:43,919
No one else knows about these passages but us.

1534
02:13:43,920 --> 02:13:46,199
No one.

1535
02:13:49,160 --> 02:13:50,759
Get him up.

1536
02:13:50,760 --> 02:13:55,319
Imren Tegin...

1537
02:14:09,120 --> 02:14:10,479
Father...

1538
02:14:17,040 --> 02:14:19,359
Attention, Osman Bey.

1539
02:14:25,760 --> 02:14:27,839
Alps.

1540
02:14:27,880 --> 02:14:29,519
Brave men.

1541
02:14:30,280 --> 02:14:34,079
Are you ready to take
what’s ours from the infidels?

1542
02:14:34,080 --> 02:14:36,199
We are my bey.

1543
02:14:36,200 --> 02:14:37,759
Oh praise be.

1544
02:14:37,760 --> 02:14:39,679
Come on then.

1545
02:14:50,040 --> 02:14:52,319
Osman Bey.

1546
02:15:08,480 --> 02:15:10,799
I have a message to you Osman Bey.

1547
02:15:10,800 --> 02:15:12,959
Tell me.

1548
02:15:15,160 --> 02:15:17,639
Imren Tegin took your Gunduz Bey.

1549
02:15:17,640 --> 02:15:19,639
you want him back..

1550
02:15:19,640 --> 02:15:23,159
...you're to go to
Atranos with the relics.

1551
02:15:31,160 --> 02:15:33,559
What are you saying?

1552
02:15:35,240 --> 02:15:37,199
What are you saying?

1553
02:15:38,320 --> 02:15:40,239
Look here.

1554
02:15:40,440 --> 02:15:43,919
If you hurt Gunduz Bey...

1555
02:15:43,960 --> 02:15:47,079
...I'll make these lands your living hell.

1556
02:15:47,600 --> 02:15:49,919
Do you understand?

1557
02:15:50,560 --> 02:15:52,479
Do you?

1558
02:15:54,360 --> 02:15:56,799
Now get out of my sight.

1559
02:15:57,120 --> 02:15:59,039
Get out.

1560
02:16:03,520 --> 02:16:05,319
What will we do now my bey?

1561
02:16:19,680 --> 02:16:21,679
Border Bazaar...

1562
02:16:22,360 --> 02:16:24,319
...Atranos...

1563
02:16:24,600 --> 02:16:26,359
...or Gunduz Bey...

1564
02:16:28,200 --> 02:16:32,638
We won’t let any of our allies
to be prisoners of that infidel!

1565
02:16:34,160 --> 02:16:38,439
We are going to take his life.

1566
02:16:39,520 --> 02:16:42,919
We will never go back from our path

1567
02:16:44,680 --> 02:16:46,119
Never!

1568
02:16:48,588 --> 02:17:04,658
Visit turkision.com for more!